 lsp-hover, read_buffer) into a single turn.\\nTools that depend on each other's output must wait for the previous result.\\n\",\"tool-results\":[],\"multi-turn\":null},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content-format\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Your first tool call must be workspace_read, exactly once, for Artifact artifact-70fce5da-1 with expected_revision 0efc79ae447ec49d6cf904fc0127be3d6073fbcfdb98a90860813d135d78110f. Do not call workspace_info or any other tool before it. This is a read-only task: never call workspace_write, EditBuffer, ReplaceBuffer, or eshell-command. If it fails, make exactly one recovery Action using the available tools. Do not answer before that Action.\",\"tool-results\":[],\"multi-turn\":null}],\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"read-file\",\"description\":\"Reads a file, or a line slice of it. For large files, prefer reading slices (offset/limit) over the whole file — pull in only what the task needs.\",\"args\":[{\"name\":\"path\",\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The path of the file to read.\"},{\"name\":\"offset\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"1-based first line of the slice to read.\",\"optional\":true},{\"name\":\"limit\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Number of lines to read from offset.\",\"optional\":true}],\"async\":null},{\"name\":\"list-files\",\"description\":\"Lists files and subdirectories in a specified directory, similar to 'ls -l'. Requires user approval.\",\"args\":[{\"name\":\"path\",\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The path to the directory to list. Defaults to the current directory if not provided.\",\"optional\":true}],\"async\":null},{\"name\":\"search-text\",\"description\":\"Searches for a textual pattern (or regular expression) in files. Requires user approval.\",\"args\":[{\"name\":\"pattern\",\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The text or regular expression to search for.\"},{\"name\":\"path\",\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The specific file or directory to search in. Defaults to the current directo